<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues airstrikes in Gaza, killing two terrorists linked to Doctors Without Borders and targeting Hamas chief al-Hayya's son, who survived the strike. Hamas chief's last surviving son also escaped an Israeli attack in Gaza City. The Israeli security cabinet is set to discuss advancing the stalled Trump Gaza plan amid US pressure, while Abbas is preparing to label Hamas a terror group, paving the way for an Eisenkot coalition. The UN warns the Gaza war has undone 77 years of human development and deepening hunger across the Middle East. 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/27/clashes-erupt-at-besiktas-europa-league-match-against-israeli-club&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/israel-officially-sanctions-torture-palestinian-prisoners-confessions-report&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNcC16Q2NmVzg5cHVUVUdSTTJ0R0JKdS1TckZSUjJ3bXVjRnBtZnJGLW5VTk5rMW54S2MzUHFwS2dJUDNkUGxSTkpfQUtOSVhPaEhLeTJsWlliYWtjb1dyeXN6MXVJejZwdVNfcmZQU0pUVnN1ckFNTzQ5ZDY5dURnU3FXSUh4dXlJaEQ3SXhieDJiSjdwVGVGaDNEN2g2dkhWbUdkdWMwMm1VNkYwMVdWN0lTNVYtQ0VDbzQtbDM1ZW02Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&